prereq:"Domain 1 (hardware: transistors, binary, buses), Domain 3 (the Linux shell, for the Raspberry Pi side) and Domain 4 (Python and C-style syntax). You need a multimeter, a starter kit built around an Arduino UNO or an ESP32, and the discipline to stay below 12 V DC until Module 1's safety rules are reflexes.",
